    "body": "Pushed e609a6ee with all four review findings fixed:\n1. **Fanuc:** names the ask once and writes no unbounded `G5.1`.\n2. **Rough ask:** stock × 0.2 capped at 0.25 mm, with no floor, so it never exceeds a fifth.\n3. **Finish ask:** half the tolerance, so it stacks to 1.5×.\n4. **New tests:** undo/redo, the round-trip with no key when off, and the reset before the program end.\n\nThe Heidenhain comment and the Tormach shared constant are fixed too.\n\nRe-gated the touched suites: smoothing 6, posting 17, conformance 6, golden_cl 23, lathe_post_g76 5, fanuc_post 11, tormach_post 10, project_roundtrip 69. Clippy is clean on app and post. Ready again.",
